  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0001",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Keith Scandone, O3 World’s CEO and co-founder, wrote for MarketingProfs about how rapid adaptation and innovation will be indispensable for thriving agencies in the 21st century.",
          "_key": "k0002"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0003",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Even if your agency has been around for years and works with staid clients, it must learn how to stay hungry. Staying hungry like a startup keeps organizations nimble, and fostering a culture of collaboration allows new ideas to flow from all directions.",
          "_key": "k0004"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0005",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At O3 World, we implemented a ",
          "_key": "k0006"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "Labs program",
          "_key": "k0007"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to encourage innovative teamwork and experimentation. Building a culture of inquiry in a collaborative environment attracts the kind of creative team players an agency needs.",
          "_key": "k0008"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
